# Environment names for the scaffold; Compose and business APIs are not implemented yet.
# Bootstrap service secrets with scripts/bootstrap.ps1 or scripts/bootstrap.sh.
# Prefer *_FILE secrets outside the repository and outside cloud-synced folders.
# Never put actual secrets in this example or in VITE_*.
